ibility of daredevil getting his own  show according to murphy's  multiverse.com a new production company  was formed less than two weeks ago  titled blind faith productions llc now  the speculation and educated guess is  that this more than likely belongs to  marvel studios this is their company  that they registered for a daredevil  project blind faith production seems to  be a clever play on one the fact that  matt murdock is literally blind and two  his catholicism in the comics now it is  worth noting that although this is very  very likely a daredevil project  especially if you consider the fact that  daredevil is now in the mcu disney has  not confirmed a daredevil project is in  the works in fact when people reached  out to disney apparently they denied  this but let's talk about why this  actually makes perfect sense daredevil  is a huge fan favorite character you can  find tons of audience reactions to matt  murdock in spider-man knowing home  online where people are just freaking  out people love daredevil so it would  make sense that they wouldn't bring him  back for just a quick little cameo plus  think about everything that is coming up  from disney plus specifically two shows  she hulk and the echo series that is  coming now matt murdock is a lawyer in  new york jennifer walters is a lawyer in  new york it would make a ton of sense  for daredevil matt murdock to appear in  the she-hulk series whether they're  friends or whether they're colleagues or  acquaintances or maybe perhaps they're  going to trial against each other at  some point in time it would just make  sense that two superhero lawyers that  both live in new york would come in  contact with each other now of course  matt murdock will know that jennifer  walters is a she-hulk but she more than  likely won't know that matt murdock is  daredevil but i'm expecting at least one  quick cameo like we saw matt murdock do  in spider-man knowing home in she-hulk  rumors have it that he could appear 