 to wonder since  they brought back charlie cox's matt  murdock slash daredevil and d'onofrio's  kingpin are they going to be bringing  anybody else back from the marvel  netflix series the marvel netflix shows  are coming to disney plus this month  marvel and disney have the rights to  these characters now and they've already  kind of rebooted two of them do they  have plans to do this for other  characters such as the punisher i  mentioned the punisher because it does  seem like marvel has started their kind  of darker side of the mcu right now moon  knight multiverse of madness blade the  werewolf by night special that is coming  hopefully ghost rider somewhere down the  line as well the punisher makes perfect  sense to bring into the mcu to join sort  of this supernatural more darker side of  the mcu and fans love jon bernthal as  the punisher and it does appear that  marvel and disney actually do kind of  take into consideration what the fans  think because we got charlie cox back as  matt murdock and dinafria back as  kingpin this proves that it's definitely  a possibility that jon could return to  play the punisher at some point in time  in the mcu as well as the rest of the  defenders i don't think they're all  going to return but i do think it's a  possibility that a few more could be  coming so big news looks like daredevil  is going to be a pretty prominent  character in the mcu if all of this  turns out to be true and perhaps we can  get a little bit of more info tomorrow  at disney's investors day tomorrow is  the 2022 annual meeting of the  shareholders and each year so far they  have kind of given us a little bit of a  tease of some projects coming up we're  not exactly sure what to expect because  it's different every year but we could  be getting some new trailer for some new  show i would not expect that thor love  and thunder trailer although there is a  chance it's possible but we'll most  likely get a look at she-hulk and miss  marvel but they a